# static/_headers — parsed by Workers Static Assets, never served as an asset.
#
# Dependency chain:
#   Zola copies static/ verbatim into public/ at build time -> Workers reads
#   public/_headers and attaches these headers to every static response.
#   Covers directives that tabi's <meta http-equiv> CSP cannot express
#   (frame-ancestors equivalent via X-Frame-Options, MIME sniffing, referrer,
#   feature policy, cross-origin isolation).
#   HSTS is deliberately ABSENT here: set it once in Cloudflare dashboard ->
#   SSL/TLS -> Edge Certificates -> HSTS (avoids duplicate headers).

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
